        "PMC10728133::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed approach can predict either thermal or electrical conductivity.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed approach should be particularly accurate when defects and impurities are present.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed approach is applicable from nearly 0 to 200 K.",
